ect. Created basic main.py function for illustrating bot's behavior", "created_at": "2022-06-21T16:01:27Z", "repo": "sunduki", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "452ff1eaecc8dd7acffd80c6a2a96262b41f2a87", "message": "Initial sunduki commit", "created_at": "2022-05-25T16:09:43Z", "repo": "sunduki", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ef21d96164aed07bc491365b1e8d9ca1aa96e276", "message": "Merge pull request #4 from nhsjdiwlcnsv/Lab_3\n\nLaboratory work #3 is complete", "created_at": "2023-08-30T12:07:59Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "458c0b1f15b7d3ff28e9b4f604d6c2a172219471", "message": "Final commit: restruct the project, add setup.py.\n\n* Rename utils to xjst to ensure that package will be uploaded to\n  Python Package Index correctly.\n* Move files, create new utils package, and store constants, helpers,\n  and templates there.\n* Add setup.py to publish the code to PyPI.", "created_at": "2023-05-04T10:14:10Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ba146f8fcfae5f3e22d6a8507e77ae38fa7b0ad", "message": "Fix XML-related bugs, add decorators support.\n\n* Fix small bugs in XML serialization/deserialization.\n* Add classmathod, staticmethod, & general decorator support.\n* Add more tests to Lab_3/tests to increase coverage.", "created_at": "2023-05-04T00:24:40Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "987e0b649cdfab4194048f9992e9681246efaa67", "message": "Add XML deserealization & tests, refactor code.\n\n* Further code refactoring improvements: move data loading from loads\n  method to create_object, rename & move other methods.\n* Add _load_from_xml_method to XMLSerializer to correctly extract data\n  from XML markup.\n* Introduce new tests from XML serialization/deserialization (draft).\n* Fix small bugs.", "created_at": "2023-05-03T00:20:59Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7a2496a4495e9116c5325e5b6d6865718ec6fbc7", "message": "Code refactoring, XML serialization (95% ready).\n\n* Move items extraction logic from JSONSerializer to Serializer class\n  because this logic stays the same for XML.\n* Add more XML templates to utils.templates, create utils.constants.\n* Add to_xml method to utils.helpers.Formatter.", "created_at": "2023-05-02T18:57:44Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9c6fc0a2efff997df9d3622dcb227d954752e46", "message": "Refactor code, introduce basic XML serialization.", "created_at": "2023-05-02T15:43:47Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "86d5736c81293f576c607270d6e3a215284d9b44", "message": "Add module serialization support, refactor code.\n\n* JSONSerializer now supports module serialization via __import__\n  function.\n* Carry out code refactoring: JSONSerializer.dumps now looks as it\n  should with much less code repeating & more spacing.\n* Modify tests/classes_an_objects.py & prepare for classmethod &\n  staticmethod serialzation.", "created_at": "2023-04-30T20:58:41Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "096fdbfa199cb97a22a719a66fd8ddb5d798b4d7", "message": "Add object & method serialization. Alter tests.\n\n* Add basic object serialization support.\n* Add method serialization support.\n* Enhance function serialization with recursions.\n* Add test & refactor test package: remove tests.config, move config\n  info to test.__init__.\n* Perform small refactoring for utils.serialize.", "created_at": "2023-04-29T23:22:23Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6e9ae90bccd6a728c3d54de509facccddcc31645", "message": "Add globals & closures, & basic classes support.\n\n* Enhance function serialization with support for global variables and\n  closures.\n* Add basic class serialization and deserialization: static & class\n  methods are not yet supported.\n* Add more tests to tests.callables & create tests for class\n  serialization: no inheritance + simple inheritance.\n* Move through TODOs and remove passed ones.", "created_at": "2023-04-29T16:28:41Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "af07db898395c2b57662e0ff041df2bbfb299dae", "message": "Introduce huge refactoring and bug fixes.\n\n* Move nearly all methods to base Serializer class & move the class\n  itself to utils.base module. The class now is not fully abstract.\n* Introduce major codestyle improvements and refactoring: get rid of\n  useless object-specific .json templates, simplify code, create new\n  Formatter class in utils.helpers.\n* Add tests for data structures (including nested dicts, lists, etc.).\n* Restore function serialization.", "created_at": "2023-04-26T21:51:25Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71285491ccaa2a966f5587c7bd75bfb6f8fa4fa1", "message": "Add nested data structures sertialzation.\n\n* Introduce codestyle fixes and small refactoring to the project: add\n  DATA_DIR to tests.config to specify where test data will be stores.\n* Alter tests.callables (minor changes).\n* Add test.iterables (empty now).\n* Add nested data structures serialization. Supports nested dicts, lists\n  and tuples (tested in utils.serialization). Also introduce tons of\n  shitty code that will be refactored ASAP.", "created_at": "2023-04-23T21:38:14Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "01d486be8ffddd0dd6517ece522957add88489b9", "message": "Add basic serialization for lists, tuples, sets.\n\n* Add new ITERABLE template to utils.temlates.json_template\n* Implement logic for list, tuple, and set serialization and\n  deserialization.\n* Nested data structures and dicts are not supported yet.", "created_at": "2023-04-11T20:53:52Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "469fafdf0b4c7562267219b6e415d9a174dfc637", "message": "Implement lambda serialization. Add lambda tests.", "created_at": "2023-04-11T13:34:42Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0afe300be059d1a4d5ccc01456d4271a5d84f9db", "message": "Fix json serialization issues & refactor methods.\n\n* Refactor JSONSerializer methods, introduce new classmethods.\n* Improve naming of the test files.\n* Better codestyle.", "created_at": "2023-04-11T12:31:14Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e5585269174792478b36d6b39d1ff1e256c712b8", "message": "Add basic testing for function serialization.\n\n* Fix small bug in serialize.py.\n* Add tests.functions.py for function serialization testing.", "created_at": "2023-04-10T22:34:58Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d0a344a5ac57cdd8796a9da3d08369a9a7a0ded", "message": "Fix function serialization bugs, refactor code", "created_at": "2023-04-10T22:14:52Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "58d57b9226dea3cd1e79e483461b2760e68c13c1", "message": "Add function serialization & json templates.\n\n* Add json templates for complex structures (e.g. functions)\n* Add function serialization and deserialization (in draft)\n* Add fucking craving for refactoring to the project", "created_at": "2023-04-09T21:55:43Z", "repo": "PythonLabs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "df8a9e9b51c62ca5e134087e41e9377955c7c4be", "message": "Add basi